{% layout none %}
{%- comment -%}
  GOD SQUAD — Gift card
  Shopify requires templates/gift_card.liquid on every theme. This is the page
  a customer lands on when they open the gift-card URL emailed to them: the
  code, the balance, the QR, and a way to print or add to Apple Wallet.

  It is not a sectioned template because Shopify serves it outside the normal
  storefront layout when printed, and every value here is either a Shopify
  object or a locale string.

  ONE script, and it is Shopify's own: vendor/qrcode.js, loaded through
  shopify_asset_url, because Shopify generates the gift-card QR client side and
  ships the generator. Nothing else here needs script, and the redemption code
  is plain text outside the QR block, so a blocked script costs the customer the
  convenience of scanning and never the ability to redeem.
{%- endcomment -%}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}" class="no-js gift-card-page">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical_url }}">

    <title>{{ 'gift_cards.issued.title' | t }} — {{ shop.name }}</title>

    {%- if settings.favicon != blank -%}
      <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ settings.favicon | image_url: width: 32, height: 32 }}">
    {%- endif -%}

    {{ 'design-tokens.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
    {{ 'base.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
    {{ 'component-button.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

    {%- comment -%}
      defer, not the script_tag filter. That filter emits a parser-blocking
      <script src> and Theme Check reports ParserBlockingScript for it. The URL
      still comes from shopify_asset_url, so this is Shopify's own copy of the
      generator rather than a third-party CDN.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <script src="{{ 'vendor/qrcode.js' | shopify_asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

    {{ content_for_header }}

    {% style %}
      .gift-card__subtext {
        margin: var(--space-3) 0 0;
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: var(--type-body-sm-size);
        line-height: var(--type-body-sm-lh);
        color: var(--color-text-current-muted);
      }

      .gift-card {
        min-height: 100svh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: var(--section-pad-block) var(--gutter-mobile);
        background: var(--color-surface);
        color: var(--color-text);
      }
      .gift-card__card {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 34rem;
        padding: var(--space-7);
        background: var(--color-surface-alt, var(--color-surface));
        border: 1px solid var(--color-text-muted);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md, 4px);
        text-align: center;
      }
      .gift-card__eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: var(--type-body-sm-size);
        letter-spacing: var(--type-eyebrow-ls);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
      }
      .gift-card__title {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: var(--type-display-m-size);
        font-weight: var(--weight-black);
        line-height: var(--type-display-m-lh);
        letter-spacing: var(--type-display-m-ls);
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .gift-card__balance {
        margin: var(--space-6) 0;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: var(--type-display-m-size);
        font-weight: var(--weight-black);
      }
      .gift-card__balance--depleted { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
      .gift-card__code {
        display: block;
        margin: var(--space-5) auto;
        padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
        font-size: var(--type-body-lg-size);
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        background: transparent;
        border: 1px dashed var(--color-text-muted);
        border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
        word-break: break-all;
      }
      .gift-card__qr {
        margin: var(--space-5) auto;
        display: block;
      }
      .gift-card__actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: var(--space-3);
        justify-content: center;
        margin-block-start: var(--space-6);
      }
      .gift-card__note {
        margin-block-start: var(--space-5);
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: var(--type-body-sm-size);
        line-height: var(--type-body-sm-lh);
      }
      @media print {
        body { background: #fff; color: #000; }
        .gift-card__actions { display: none; }
      }
    {% endstyle %}
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="gift-card">
      <div class="gift-card__card">
        <p class="gift-card__eyebrow">{{ shop.name }}</p>
        <h1 class="gift-card__title">{{ 'gift_cards.issued.title' | t }}</h1>

        {%- if gift_card.enabled and gift_card.expired == false -%}
          <p class="gift-card__subtext">{{ 'gift_cards.issued.subtext' | t }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if gift_card.enabled and gift_card.expired == false -%}
          <p class="gift-card__balance">
            {{ gift_card.balance | money }}
          </p>
        {%- else -%}
          <p class="gift-card__balance gift-card__balance--depleted">
            {%- if gift_card.expired -%}
              {{ 'gift_cards.issued.expired' | t }}
            {%- else -%}
              {{ 'gift_cards.issued.redeemed' | t }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          The QR the cashier scans in store.

          This line used to pipe a "qr_identifier_url" property through a
          "qr_code_svg" filter. Neither exists: the gift_card object carries
          qr_identifier and Liquid has no such filter, so Theme Check reported
          UnknownFilter and the element rendered nothing at all -- on the one
          page a paying customer reaches from an email.

          Shopify generates it client side and ships the generator itself, so
          the script below is Shopify's own asset rather than a third party.
          That is the single exception to this file's no-JavaScript rule, and it
          is noted at the top of the file for that reason: without script the
          code beneath is still readable and still redeemable, which is why the
          <code> element is not inside this block.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="gift-card__qr" id="GiftCardQr" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <code class="gift-card__code">{{ gift_card.code | format_code }}</code>

        <div class="gift-card__actions">
          <a href="{{ shop.url }}" class="button button--accent">
            {{ 'gift_cards.issued.shop_link' | t }}
          </a>
          <button type="button" class="button" onclick="window.print()">
            {{ 'gift_cards.issued.print' | t }}
          </button>
        </div>

        {%- if gift_card.pass_url -%}
          <p class="gift-card__note">
            <a href="{{ gift_card.pass_url }}">{{ 'gift_cards.issued.add_to_apple_wallet' | t }}</a>
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}

        <p class="gift-card__note">
          {{ 'gift_cards.issued.disabled_gift_card' | t }}
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>
    <script>
      // gift_card.qr_identifier is the string Shopify documents for this.
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
        var el = document.getElementById('GiftCardQr');
        if (!el || typeof QRCode === 'undefined') return;
        new QRCode(el, {
          text: {{ gift_card.qr_identifier | json }},
          width: 140,
          height: 140
        });
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
